OL,3,GNEWSASussex reacts to halting of
OL,4,Acouncil reorganisation
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrustration? Disappointment? Or a
OL,7,F'common sense decision' that's 'clearly
OL,8,Fthe right step'?
OL,10,FSussex leaders have varying views on
OL,11,Fthe government putting plans to shake
OL,12,Fup our councils on hold following new
OL,13,Flegal advice.
OL,15,FA controversial decision to expand
OL,16,FBrighton & Hove eastwards to take in
OL,17,FEast Saltdean, Peacehaven and Telscombe
OL,18,Fwill be reviewed.
